Distributed Strands-derived adaptation paths covered by Apache-2.0:

  src/strands_gemma_order_stable_hybrid/option_branches.py
  tests/test_option_branches.py

The source module adapts the accepted isolated-option retrofit and composes
with the pinned Strands typed engine, renderer, schema, model wrapper, and
PointerHead interfaces. The changes add isolated semantic-option branches,
equal logical option positions, full batch-one branch recomputation,
pointer-feature extraction, semantic mapping, and corresponding tests. This
exact package path was not present in the pinned upstream tree.

